// into a Y 1.78e-8 off the 320-bit solution at a nil error (rv49 3641,
// NoScaling false; BN4LWB ruling 7). The X enclosure does not bound Y,
// so such a result takes tier 2, whose Hewer fixed point carries its own Y.
